{"id":"3b0e1c2615f805e4","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-validity-fo.md","title":"语境中的集合语义有效性","display":"df-first-order-validity — 语境中的集合语义有效性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-validity-fo","aliases":["16-df-validity-fo","First-order validity"],"display":"df-first-order-validity — 语境中的集合语义有效性","depends_on":["[[16-df-formula]]","[[16-df-satisfaction]]"],"source":"§0.2 pp. 11–13 (PDF 31–33); §4.3 functorial interpretation, local set instance","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-validity-fo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-validity-fo</span><span>First-order validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-validity — 语境中的集合语义有效性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73482b453f46909f\" href=\"?note=73482b453f46909f\" title=\"16-df-satisfaction\">16-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§0.2 pp. 11–13 (PDF 31–33); §4.3 functorial interpretation, local set instance"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为该多排序签名的集合模型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\beta\\models\\varphi\">\\(M,\\beta\\models\\varphi\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"73482b453f46909f\" href=\"?note=73482b453f46909f\" title=\"16-df-satisfaction\">16-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 为无重复变量的有限列表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)\">\\(M\\models_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)\\)</span> 是本页定义的语义蕴涵记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)\\mid M,\\beta\\models\\varphi\\},\\\\\nM\\models_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}\\subseteq⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)\\mid M,\\beta\\models\\varphi\\},\\\\\nM\\models_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}\\subseteq⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§0.2, pp. 11–13 (PDF 31–33) 的谓词偏序模型及 §4.3 的解释观点。这里每个需要的赋值/满足符号均有实际定义，不再依赖一个只写名字的 satisfaction 节点；语境含空排序时赋值集可能为空，蕴涵按子集包含真空成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"73482b453f46909f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)$ 见 [[16-df-formula]]；$M$ 为该多排序签名的集合模型，$\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)$ 及 $M,\\beta\\models\\varphi$ 采用 [[16-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"73482b453f46909f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)$ 见 [[16-df-formula]]；$M$ 为该多排序签名的集合模型，$\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)$ 及 $M,\\beta\\models\\varphi$ 采用 [[16-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\beta\\models\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"M\\models_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)\\mid M,\\beta\\models\\varphi\\},\\\\\nM\\models_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}\\subseteq⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1494,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["24a3d0c12f4602b7","73482b453f46909f"]}